// label "", width 1.0, color "", xline's style "--", grid's on true); `lib figure` of type 6 (Figure),
// `lib panel` and `lib twin_y` of type 7 (Axes), the others type 1 under `eval`; figure's options given
// out of order are all constants, so its `seq` binds nothing (`seq ... 0`, L-dc); plot's `label: s[0]`
